# Endless Map's public repository holds the add-on and its front page - nothing else.
# Everything is ignored except what is listed here, so nothing else can be added by accident: the development tools,
# tests, notes and game data live in a separate, private repository and never come here.

# 1. At the top: only these.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/.github/
!/AzerothUnrolled/

# 2. .github: only the community files (contributing, code of conduct, security policy, pull request template), the
#    issue forms and the CurseForge automation (the workflow and its script).
/.github/**
!/.github/**/
!/.github/*.md
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*.yml
!/.github/workflows/*.yml
!/.github/scripts/*.py

# 3. The add-on: only what the game loads and the documents it ships - the Lua and TOC files, its pictures (TGA, BLP),
#    the readmes, changelogs and notices beside the TOC, and the licence.
/AzerothUnrolled/**
!/AzerothUnrolled/**/
!/AzerothUnrolled/**/*.lua
!/AzerothUnrolled/**/*.toc
!/AzerothUnrolled/**/*.tga
!/AzerothUnrolled/**/*.blp
!/AzerothUnrolled/*.md
!/AzerothUnrolled/LICENSE
